{
  "_comment": [
    "v4.2.0 动画事件 / 最小状态机配置(攻击粒子用;目前仅预留,插件读入后按 weapons/presets 驱动)。",
    "时间全部是「动画绝对秒」;超过实际动画时长的事件会被自动丢弃(filter t < AnimationController.current.duration)。",
    "place = EU5 的 hierarchy_place(locator)。当前 g3dj 不导出 locator,place 仅作记录;",
    "  实际锚点走 locatorFallback(weapon_tip=武器部件尖端 / grip=骨原点 / bbox_front=包围盒前缘)。",
    "preset 见本文件末尾 presets;animSets 对应 models/assembly.json 的 animSets 键。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "particleScale": 1,
  "particleRate": 1,
  "particleMax": 256,
  "locatorFallback": "weapon_tip",
  "battleHoldMs": 1200,

  "stateMachine": {
    "_comment": [
      "把游戏四态(idle/move/battle/retreat)映射成 EU5 UnitState;先 Idle→Attack 等时间线播完,",
      "Attack→Move/Idle 立即切换;进入 Idle/Move/Retreat 时随机相位(randomPhase=true)避免同兵种齐步。",
      "transitions 里 when 是条件表达式(state=当前 UnitState,tlEnd=当前时间线是否播完)。"
    ],
    "unitState": {
      "idle": 0,
      "attack": 1,
      "move": 2,
      "retreat": 3,
      "charge": 4
    },
    "randomPhase": true,
    "transitions": {
      "Idle": [
        { "to": "Move", "when": "state==2" },
        { "to": "Charge", "when": "state==4" },
        { "to": "Retreat", "when": "state==3" },
        { "to": "Attack", "when": "state==1 && tlEnd" }
      ],
      "Attack": [
        { "to": "Move", "when": "state==2" },
        { "to": "Retreat", "when": "state==3" },
        { "to": "Idle", "when": "state!=1" }
      ],
      "Move": [
        { "to": "Idle", "when": "state!=2" }
      ],
      "Retreat": [
        { "to": "Idle", "when": "state!=3" }
      ],
      "Charge": [
        { "to": "Idle", "when": "state!=4" }
      ]
    }
  },

